<title>SPAIN: Spain's Uralita reshuffles management.</title>
<headline>Spain's Uralita reshuffles management.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish construction group Uralita said on Wednesday it had reorganised its management structure in line with a strategic plan.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement it had named Eugenio Ruiz-Galvez, former managing director, as new vice president for international development. Manuel Masnou will take over as new managing director.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2151</p>
